# Template for hosts/<host>/etc-hosts.local, which is untracked (.gitignore) because a
# LAN map and WAN addresses do not belong in a public repo. Copy to etc-hosts.local,
# fill in the real entries, and stage it to /sources/hosts.local before a build -- same
# convention as kernel-config.sh. ch09-network appends it to the loopback block the book
# generates; if the file is absent the build still produces a complete, working
# /etc/hosts, so this is optional.

# Local
# 192.168.0.10    nas
# 192.168.0.11    printer

# wireguard vpn (this host is 10.0.0.2)
# 10.0.0.1        router
# 10.0.0.4        server

# Remote
# 203.0.113.10    router-remote
